<title>UK: BP raises November European LPG prices - trade.</title>
<headline>BP raises November European LPG prices - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum on Thursday raised its November liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) prices by $7.50-$26.00 per tonne, traders said.</p>
<p>Propane rose by $26 to $264 per tonne and butane gained $7.50 to $232.50 per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
